acct
anygroup
audit
auth
boot
chown
chroot
cron
isso
linkdir
lp
mem
mknod
mount
operator
password
ping
printerstat
sysadmin
tape

auth:		password
isso:		audit auth boot mem tape
lp:		printerstat
operator:	boot lp mount tape
sysadmin:	acct anygroup auth boot chown chroot cron linkdir lp mem mknod mount ping tape
